-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ג/4 — תשלום פעימה שלישית של תוספת השכר במגזר הציבורי
-- (תוספת 2011) לעובדי הוראה המועסקים בבעלויות בחטיבה העליונה
-- The third instalment of the 2011 public-sector raise for teachers employed
-- by the owners in the upper division: from 1.1.2013 to 30.6.2013 the 2011
-- supplement rises to 6.25% and the '94 and '87 shekel supplements to the
-- amounts printed, by employment terms; payment from January 2013's salary.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Dates are numbers YYYYMMDD; salary months are numbers YYYYMM.
`1 January 2013` MEANS 20130101
`30 June 2013`   MEANS 20130630

§ `חוזר תשע"ג/4 פעימה שלישית תוספת 2011 בחטיבה העליונה`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead and the circular's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 Refers to circulars תשע"ב/2 (18.9.2011) and תשע"ב/9 (28.3.2012) and announces that the third instalment is paid under the teachers' collective agreements as set out below; the rules are the sections that follow.

@desc A teaching employee as this circular asks about them.
DECLARE `upper-division teacher` HAS
    `graded as a teaching employee`        IS A BOOLEAN @desc graded in the teaching-employees grading
    `employed by a supervised owner`       IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed by an owner of education supervised by the Ministry of Education
    `upper-division fraction`              IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a position held in the upper division (1 = a full position)
    `other-division fraction`              IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a position held in teaching hours outside the upper division
    `employment terms`                     IS AN `employment terms for the shekel supplements`

-- The three groups section ב.1(ב) prices separately.
DECLARE `employment terms for the shekel supplements` IS ONE OF
    `not employed under a reform, or a principal under Oz LeTmura`
    `a non-principal in partial implementation of Oz LeTmura`
    `a non-principal in full implementation of Oz LeTmura`

§§ `א. תחולה`

@ref akn:art_a/p1
GIVEN t IS AN `upper-division teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` t IF
        t's `graded as a teaching employee`
    AND t's `employed by a supervised owner`
    AND t's `upper-division fraction` GREATER THAN 0

-- Applied "by their fraction of employment in the upper division only".
@ref akn:art_a/p1
GIVEN t IS AN `upper-division teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the fraction this circular prices` t IS
    IF `the circular applies to` t THEN t's `upper-division fraction` ELSE 0

-- ¶2: for hours outside the upper division the 2011, '94 and '87
-- supplements go on being paid as in the salary of 12/2012 (as circular
-- תשע"ב/9 sets out). What was paid then is an input: this circular does
-- not restate it.
@ref akn:art_a/p2
GIVEN t IS AN `upper-division teacher`
      `the amount paid for that fraction in 12/2012` IS A NUMBER @desc the supplements paid in the salary of December 2012 for the hours outside the upper division (circular תשע"ב/9)
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the supplements for the other-division fraction` t `the amount paid for that fraction in 12/2012` IS
    `the amount paid for that fraction in 12/2012`

§§ `ב. השלמה ל-6.25%`

-- akn:art_b__para_1 Heading of ב.1: "for teaching employees entitled to the 2011 supplement"; the condition is carried by the rules below.

-- ב.1(א): from 1.1.2013 to 30.6.2013 the 2011 supplement is a uniform
-- 6.25%. Outside that window the circular states no rate (finding
-- F-2012-13_tashag_04-a): NOTHING is what the text gives.
@ref akn:art_b__para_1__subpara_a
GIVEN `date` IS A NUMBER @desc a date, YYYYMMDD
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 supplement rate under this circular on` `date` IS
    IF `date` AT LEAST `1 January 2013` AND `date` AT MOST `30 June 2013`
    THEN JUST (6.25%)
    ELSE NOTHING

-- ב.1(ב) and its second paragraph: the amounts, by employment terms, for
-- 1.1.2013–30.6.2013, as printed.
@ref akn:art_b__para_1__subpara_b akn:art_b__para_1__subpara_b/p2
DECLARE `shekel supplement` IS ONE OF
    `the '94 teaching-reinforcement supplement`
    `the '87 agreement supplement`

GIVEN e IS AN `employment terms for the shekel supplements`, s IS A `shekel supplement`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the shekel amount` e s IS
    CONSIDER e
    WHEN `not employed under a reform, or a principal under Oz LeTmura` THEN
        CONSIDER s
        WHEN `the '94 teaching-reinforcement supplement` THEN 156.75
        WHEN `the '87 agreement supplement`              THEN 174.31
    WHEN `a non-principal in partial implementation of Oz LeTmura` THEN
        CONSIDER s
        WHEN `the '94 teaching-reinforcement supplement` THEN 187.74
        WHEN `the '87 agreement supplement`              THEN 208.77
    WHEN `a non-principal in full implementation of Oz LeTmura` THEN
        CONSIDER s
        WHEN `the '94 teaching-reinforcement supplement` THEN 218.72
        WHEN `the '87 agreement supplement`              THEN 243.22

GIVEN e IS AN `employment terms for the shekel supplements`, s IS A `shekel supplement`, `date` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the shekel amount under this circular on` e s `date` IS
    IF `date` AT LEAST `1 January 2013` AND `date` AT MOST `30 June 2013`
    THEN JUST (`the shekel amount` e s)
    ELSE NOTHING

-- F-2012-13_tashag_04-a: the raise is given for a closed window only, and
-- nothing in the circular says what the rate or the amounts are from
-- 1.7.2013. The text gives no answer for a date after 30.6.2013:
`the circular gives no 2011 rate for 1 July 2013` MEANS
    `the 2011 supplement rate under this circular on` 20130701 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the circular gives no 2011 rate for 1 July 2013`

`the circular gives no '87 amount for 1 July 2013` MEANS
    `the shekel amount under this circular on` `not employed under a reform, or a principal under Oz LeTmura` `the '87 agreement supplement` 20130701 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the circular gives no '87 amount for 1 July 2013`

§§ `ג. ביצוע תשלומים ושיפויים`

DECLARE `instalment action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the raised supplements` HAS `from salary month` IS A NUMBER
    `reimburse the owners` HAS `from tuition-payment month` IS A NUMBER

-- ג ¶1: the owners carry this out from the salary of January 2013. Time
-- is counted in months from January 2013 (0 = the January 2013 salary).
@ref akn:art_c/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `instalment action`
DECIDE `the owners pay from January 2013` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the raised supplements` m PROVIDED m AT MOST 201301
    WITHIN 0
    LEST  BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "circular תשע\"ג/4, section ג: the raise is paid from the salary of January 2013"

-- ג ¶2: the Ministry reimburses the owners from the tuition payment of
-- January 2013, paid at the start of February 2013 (month 1 on this clock).
@ref akn:art_c/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `instalment action`
DECIDE `the Ministry reimburses from January 2013` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `reimburse the owners` m PROVIDED m AT MOST 201301
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "circular תשע\"ג/4, section ג: reimbursement from the January 2013 tuition payment, paid early February 2013"

-- akn:conclusions The contact line, the greeting and the signature; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- The teacher below is an illustration, not a payslip.
`a half-time upper-division teacher` MEANS
    `upper-division teacher` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee`  IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised owner` IS TRUE
        `upper-division fraction`        IS 0.5
        `other-division fraction`        IS 0.3
        `employment terms`               IS `a non-principal in full implementation of Oz LeTmura`

#ASSERT `the fraction this circular prices` `a half-time upper-division teacher` EQUALS 0.5
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement rate under this circular on` 20130315 EQUALS JUST (6.25%)
#ASSERT `the shekel amount` `a non-principal in full implementation of Oz LeTmura` `the '87 agreement supplement` EQUALS 243.22
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement rate under this circular on` 20121231 EQUALS NOTHING

#TRACE `the owners pay from January 2013` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the raised supplements` 201301 AT 0
#TRACE `the Ministry reimburses from January 2013` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education` DOES `reimburse the owners` 201301 AT 1
